# ===== Sensitive config files (real values, never commit) =====
# This blocks application.properties/yaml in every service folder,
# no matter how deep it is nested.
**/application.properties
**/application.yml
**/application.yaml
**/.env

# ===== Maven build output =====
**/target/
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# ===== IntelliJ IDEA =====
**/.idea/
**/*.iml
**/*.ipr
**/*.iws
**/out/

# ===== Eclipse / STS =====
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings/
**/.factorypath
**/bin/

# ===== VS Code =====
**/.vscode/

# ===== OS junk =====
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# ===== Logs =====
**/*.log
**/logs/

# ===== Java =====
**/*.class

# ===== Docker (if you add compose overrides later with real values) =====
**/docker-compose.override.yml
